<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank sets 4wk bill auction Thurs, 16.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank sets 4wk bill auction Thurs, 16.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank said on Wednesday it would offer nine billion crowns in four-week finance ministry treasury bills in a previously unscheduled auction on Thursday with gross yield on bids limited to a maximum 16.2 percent.</p>
<p>The limit yield corresponds to minimum bid on each one million crown bill of 987,554 crowns, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
